{"5036420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "He Was Here", "steam_appid": 5036420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an unnamed employee of <strong>Tervex Industries</strong>, one of the world's most powerful corporations, controlling <strong>60% of global production, research and development, and defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your assignment is to investigate the mind of <strong>Alex Smith</strong>, a psychiatric patient experiencing psychosis. Using experimental technology developed by Tervex Industries, you can enter her mind and experience her memories firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a mysterious 2000s-era computer  and step directly into Alex's fragmented memories as playable first-person experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange and surreal environments shaped by Alex's fractured perception. Solve puzzles, uncover hidden memories, and piece together the disturbing secrets buried within her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the less you can trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He was here. But who?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an unnamed employee of <strong>Tervex Industries</strong>, one of the world's most powerful corporations, controlling <strong>60% of global production, research and development, and defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your assignment is to investigate the mind of <strong>Alex Smith</strong>, a psychiatric patient experiencing psychosis. Using experimental technology developed by Tervex Industries, you can enter her mind and experience her memories firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a mysterious 2000s-era computer  and step directly into Alex's fragmented memories as playable first-person experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange and surreal environments shaped by Alex's fractured perception. Solve puzzles, uncover hidden memories, and piece together the disturbing secrets buried within her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the less you can trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He was here. But who?</strong></p>", "short_description": "A psychological horror game where you play as an unnamed employee of Tervex Industries. Navigate a 2000s-era computer to explore the fragmented memories of Alex Smith, a patient experiencing psychosis. Piece together her distorted memories and uncover disturbing family secrets.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036420/0ab437cbbdff1272d2f8f40c13f16aced95b9968/header.jpg?t=1788076349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036420/9304023d1060c92d05963f1badd18e4c4b985592/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788076349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036420/9304023d1060c92d05963f1badd18e4c4b985592/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788076349", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12 compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple S